&lt;p&gt;Now flags &lt;tt&gt;skipStore&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;storeUsed&lt;/tt&gt; passed from primary node to backups and &lt;tt&gt;GridDhtTxRemote&lt;/tt&gt; starts with proper &lt;tt&gt;storeUsed&lt;/tt&gt; value.&lt;/p&gt;

